otg.guide.faq.tier_order.q=可以跳级升級吗？
otg.guide.faq.tier_order.a=不可以。順序是基礎 → 銅 → 鐵 → 金 → 鑽石 → 獄髓。太高阶的升級物品会被拒絕。
otg.guide.faq.furnace.q=熔爐如何工作？
otg.guide.faq.furnace.a=虚拟熔爐先使用儲罐岩漿，再使用背包内岩漿桶。使用后留下空桶。
otg.guide.faq.tanks.q=儲罐如何工作？
otg.guide.faq.tanks.a=銅以上可儲存水和岩漿。容量为 20、40、60、80、100。自動吸入会返还空桶。
otg.guide.faq.overpack.q=Overpack 是什么？
otg.guide.faq.overpack.a=Overpack is a Netherite-only storage expansion module. It adds Page 2 and uses the page button to swap between Page 1 and Page 2. Passive priority/mainhand helpers are readonly, so Page 1/Page 2 should not mix during logout/login. Stockpile is separate from Overpack and stores filtered bulk items as virtual counts, not as Page 2 slots.
otg.guide.faq.rest.q=休息营火如何工作？
otg.guide.faq.rest.a=部署后选择早晨、正午、夜晚或午夜。多人会使用投票。
otg.guide.faq.cosmetics.q=外觀在放置模式如何運作？
otg.guide.faq.cosmetics.a=把有效外觀放入外觀槽，切換到放置模式並放下背包。放置後的背包應保留外觀模型。無效外觀會被安全彈出。
otg.guide.faq.placement.q=為什麼這裡不能放置背包？
otg.guide.faq.placement.a=放置模式需要清空且有支撐的表面。請看向有效方塊面，避開液體、地毯和被阻擋的位置，並確認 BP/RP 版本一致。
otg.guide.faq.special_items.q=Can I store Potions or Tipped Arrows in the backpack?
otg.guide.faq.special_items.a=In the public-stable build, no. Potions, Tipped Arrows, and similar special ItemStack items are blocked from normal backpack storage and returned/ejected for multiplayer stability. Legacy QIDB-backed special items are not loaded by this public build. Recover them with an older rescue-capable build before updating; new Potion and Tipped Arrow storage remains blocked.
otg.guide.faq.offhand_display.q=What does Offhand Backpack Display do?
otg.guide.faq.offhand_display.a=It only controls the fake visual backpack item shown in the Offhand for display. Turn it off from Guidebook > Backpack Settings (Personal) if you dislike the visual. Quick Open, modules, carry priority, and the real Offhand slot still work.
otg.guide.faq.netherite_stations.q=What extra stations does Netherite unlock?
otg.guide.faq.netherite_stations.a=Netherite adds Brewing Stand, Smithing Table, Ender Chest, and the Max Enchanting Setup. The enchanting button places a protected temporary 5x6 structure with a real Enchantment Table and a full bookshelf arrangement. It needs no player-supplied Bookshelves, rotates to face the deploying player, clears harmless grass/flower/fern/bush/leaf-litter/snow-layer ground cover, cannot be harvested for free blocks, and is removed with no drops when broken, replaced, or left behind.
otg.guide.faq.teleport_guard.q=What happens if Waystones teleport me while a backpack is active?
otg.guide.faq.teleport_guard.a=OTG uses a generic teleport guard. If you suddenly move too far or change dimension while a backpack helper is active, the addon tries to save the actual open backpack, close stale helpers, clear Quick Open state, and rebuild helpers after a short safety window.
otg.guide.faq.priority_helper.q=Why are priority helpers readonly?
otg.guide.faq.priority_helper.a=Slot 9, personal carry slot, Offhand, and Mainhand helpers may exist while a backpack is only being carried. They must not write storage unless the backpack UI is actually open. This prevents carried backpacks from clearing slots or mixing Overpack pages during logout/login.
otg.guide.faq.stockpile.q=How does Stockpile work?
otg.guide.faq.stockpile.a=Stockpile is a Netherite-only bulk storage module. Place simple stackable filter items in the Stockpile filter slots, then matching items can be collected into a virtual count instead of filling normal backpack slots. Use the row Withdraw buttons to return stored items. The Stockpile module stays locked while it still contains stored items, so withdraw the stored items before removing the module. It does not store Potions, Tipped Arrows, or special QIDB-style ItemStack data.
